  m_Name: Millie
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DollConfig
  dollName: Millie
  dollOwner: Danna Ferko, 6 y.o., female, alive
  dollStory: Danna Ferko has ran away from home, only to be found two days later
    in a shocking state. The only item that Danna had, was her favourite doll, "Millie".
    When Danna was found, she, and her doll were lying next to a corpse. The body
    was found out to be Gregory Ferko, Danna's uncle, who has gone missing a few
    weeks before the incident.
  dollReason: "Millie is nothing more than a simple, unpossessed doll. However, the
    story of Danna and her uncle Gregory is far more tragic. After further investigation,
    it was discovered that Gregory, who often spent time babysitting Danna, took
    his own life at the spot where they loved to go for walks together. When Gregory
    went missing, Danna set out to find him, only to discover his lifeless body at
    their favorite place. The reason behind Gregory's suicide was linked to his long
    struggle with depression. According to Danna's mother\u2014Gregory's sister\u2014the
    two had recently argued about Gregory's alcohol abuse. Following the argument,
    Gregory was no longer allowed to see Danna, whom he had once described as his
    only source of happiness."
